Z_03: none exact?\n\nB1_PRRM_05: none exact.\n\nThus for those with exact we can cite.\n\nNow craft action items: For each machine with exact case, provide reference week and actions. For others, state no case.\n\nAlso need to discuss Rework Rate trend and BYPASS risk (has_risk true). Include details from detect.\n\nNow produce final report with markdown headings.\n\nProceed.', type='reasoning_text')], encrypted_content=None, status=None), type='reasoning_item')
