09, B1_SPUT_03, B1_DSCM_02.\n\nProvide action items referencing those cases.\n\nAlso need to address bypass risk: PR1 and PR2 layers, suggest investigation and trace.\n\nNow compose report.\n\n', type='reasoning_text')], encrypted_content=None, status=None), type='reasoning_item')
